            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Gold, silver, & Strategy trade lower; Brookfield's cloud business",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance Markets and Data Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> takes a look at some of Wednesday's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/trending/\">trending tickers</a> and stories.</p>\n<p>Silver (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SI=F\">SI=F</a>) and gold (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GC=F\">GC=F</a>) are retreating from earlier gains.</p>\n<p>Strategy (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSTR\">MSTR</a>) stock is moving lower amid bitcoin's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) slump.</p>\n<p>Brookfield (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BN\">BN</a>) is reportedly starting its own cloud business, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/brookfield-start-cloud-business-lower-cost-ai\">according to The Information</a>.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
